of the protagonist:\n\nhttps://www.reddit.com/media?url=https%3A%2F%2Fi.redd.it%2Fxpy1qccitivc1.jpeg\n\nhttps://i.pinimg.com/1200x/1f/4d/8e/1f4d8e856f7bc26fd372318e6b6980cd.jpg\n\nhttps://i.pinimg.com/1200x/1f/4d/8e/1f4d8e856f7bc26fd372318e6b6980cd.jpg\n\n(Any variation of this is good!)\n\nFor her expression, I would like for it to be similar to the first pose reference photo. While her face might not reveal too much emotion, I would like for there to be determination in her eyes.\n\nFor Maya's skin color, please refer to this photo:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1nTL2RuwixIopSgwlUqehebWQOIPtdQwy/view?usp=sharing\n\nMaya's hair has two colors: black and blue. I would like for the blue parts to be changed to match Makoto's hair color (a dark blue). I would also like for her eye color to match his eye color as well!\n\nI would like to post the final picture to Twitter, with credit. \n\nThank you so much!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1035715, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "げりぎみん@skeb", "screen_name": "gerigimi18", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1405147459173568522/Aeb0YJyH.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1252935656239624192/1730960850/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1500892, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ろっぷちょっぷ/Illustrator", "screen_name": "ropchopgraphic", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1822579655125475328/IL0q13av.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2584537100/1767125723/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular